CPEDAL 1
NAME "BearFoot Blueberry Bass Overdrive Reference Draft"

# Reconstructed from the supplied BearFoot/Effects Layouts reference and
# cross-checked against the Aion Procyon/Honey Bee family schematic. This is
# the engaged audio path only; power LED and bypass switching are omitted.
#
# The Blueberry substitutions represented here include the 47k/47k reference
# divider, 22n input coupling, red clipping LEDs, 47n JFET coupling, 2k Nature
# source leg, 27k output resistor and 2n2 high-cut capacitor.

V VRAW VRAW 0 9
R R_SUPPLY VRAW VA 51
C C_SUPPLY_1 VA 0 100n
C C_SUPPLY_2 VA 0 100u
C C_SUPPLY_3 VA 0 470n
AUDIO GUITAR INPUT 0 0.20

# Half-supply reference.
R R_VB_TOP VA VB 47k
R R_VB_BOTTOM VB 0 47k
C C_VB VB 0 22u

# Input coupling and bias.
R RPD INPUT 0 2M2
C C1 INPUT INPUT_BIAS 22n
R R1 VB INPUT_BIAS 360k
R R2 INPUT_BIAS OP_PLUS 14k7

# Main CA3130 overdrive stage.
OPAMP U1 OP_PLUS OP_MINUS OP_OUT VA 0 CA3130EZ

# Anti-parallel red LEDs in the feedback loop.
D D1 OP_MINUS OP_OUT LED_RED
D D2 OP_OUT OP_MINUS LED_RED
R R3 OP_MINUS DRIVE_LOW 3k
POT DRIVE DRIVE_LOW OP_OUT OP_OUT 250k LOG 0.55

# Low-frequency feedback leg.
R R4 OP_MINUS LOW_FB 1k
C C3 LOW_FB 0 220n

# Post-op-amp coupling and silicon hard clipping.
R R5 OP_OUT POST_COUPLE 1k
C C7 POST_COUPLE CLAMP_A 1u
D D3 CLAMP_A 0 1N4007
D D4 0 CLAMP_A 1N4007

# Frequency-dependent feedback/filter paths.
C C8 CLAMP_A FB_A 22n
R R6 FB_A OP_MINUS 27k

R R7 CLAMP_A CLAMP_B 10k
C C10 CLAMP_B 0 22n
C C9 CLAMP_B FB_B 4n7
R R8 FB_B OP_MINUS 147k

# JFET recovery/output stage.
C C11 CLAMP_B Q1G 47n
R R9 Q1G 0 1M
JFET Q1 Q1D Q1G Q1S 2N5457
R R10 VA Q1D 5k6
R R11 Q1S 0 2k6

# Blueberry Nature control. One side alters low-frequency source bypass while
# the other provides the final high-cut path, preserving the unusual interactive
# control arrangement from the supplied reference.
R R12 Q1S TONE_BASS 2k
C C12 TONE_BASS TONE_1 22n
POT TONE TONE_1 0 TONE_3 50k LOG 0.50

C C13 Q1D OUTPUT_PRE 1u
R R14 OUTPUT_PRE LEVEL_TOP 27k
C C15 LEVEL_TOP TONE_3 2n2
POT VOLUME 0 OUT LEVEL_TOP 50k LIN 0.55
R R_OUT_LOAD OUT 0 1M

# At the nominal mid-volume test point the simulated analogue circuit has useful
# output gain, but the previous 0.5 FS/V calibration made the live wet signal
# roughly 13 dB quieter than bypass. This is interface calibration only; the
# circuit voltages, clipping network and control behaviour are unchanged.
OUTPUT OUT 2
